;; Holiday gold vectors for tests/holiday-suite-test.lisp
;;
;; Each row: (SPEC YEAR MONTH DAY HOLIDAY-P NAME-SUBSTRING)
;;
;; SPEC is a registry name (string) or (CODE YEAR) for a gazette/decree-bound
;; constructor (CN/GB/RU/IN/… :year). HOLIDAY-P is T or NIL. NAME-SUBSTRING,
;; when non-NIL, must appear in HOLIDAY-P's second value (case-insensitive).
;;
;; US :US-FEDERAL-IN-LIEU is :NEAREST-WEEKDAY — the weekend nominal is *moved*
;; (Sat→Fri, Sun→Mon), not kept. JP 振替 and UK exclusive-next keep/shift as
;; documented in docs/AUTHORITIES.md. Dates below are statutory / already
;; pinned in the era tests — not dumped from the implementation.
(
 ;; --- US federal (5 U.S.C. § 6103) 2024 — all weekdays, no in-lieu ---
 ("USFED" 2024 1 1 t "New Year")
